# Use the playground

**Verify:** WASM mode shows lowered Roc; it does not snapshot HTML.

```sh
cargo run -q -p rocci-cli -- playground examples/rocci/standalone/styling/Styling.rocci
cargo run -q -p rocci-cli -- playground examples/rocci/standalone/styling/Styling.rocci --mode local
```

`--mode wasm` (default) parses and lowers inside a Web Worker. HTML preview is
unavailable there: generating HTML requires `roc`, which cannot run client-side.
`--mode local` can snapshot component HTML through native Roc.

This page is Rocci-only. `rocdown playground` is a different binary for
`.rocdown` files.

**Related:** [Generated Roc](/docs/reference/language/generated-roc/).
